      "x": 157.99998,
      "y": -253.99998,
      "image": "Demon Lord's Advent.png",
      "Desc": "*After combat begins, this skill enters Cooldown.<br><br>Apply 15 stacks of \"Cripple\", \"Vulnerability\", \"Bleed\", \"Confusion\", and \"Curse\" to all foes for 2 turns. Dispel all enemy buffs.<br>Allies (except self) recover 10% of Fouco's current Sanity each turn and gain \"Purify\" for 3 turns.<br>",
